  "description": "The farmers' vertical lander: a squat eight-sided capsule in cream pressed steel with an orange band, a glass cab low on its nose and four legs angled out to broad pads. It drops straight down from a ship in orbit to a field on four lift jets in the skirt under its belly and climbs back the same way. Below, the cockpit (two couches, the flight computer between them, suit lockers) and the belly hatch, which slides down to the ground with the ladder on it; a ladder up to the systems deck (power plant, batteries, life support, room for crates).",
